	(text "POWER: 5V USB bank -> OnOff SHIM -> Pi 5V rail and DRV8833 VCC.\nMotor current therefore passes through the SHIM load switch (~2A).\nCap VERBOT_ACTION_SPEED near +/-60 and rely on C1 for transients.\n+5V: pins 2,4 | +3V3: 1,17 | GND: 6,9,14,20,25,30,34,39" (at 25.4 120.65 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "57fc5058-6cdb-4860-b86d-a32bf768545f"))
