	(text "INTERROGATION SWITCHES - all inputs, internal pull-ups, ACTIVE LOW.\nWhite is the common ground return for all eight.\n\n  colour   order  action         BCM  Pi pin\n  purple     1    stop            22    15\n  red        2    rotate right    26    37\n  yellow     3    rotate left     10    19\n  grey       4    forwards         9    21\n  blue       5    reverse         25    22\n  brown      6    put down        11    23\n  orange     7    pick up          8    24\n  green      8    talk             7    26\n\nARM LIMIT SWITCHES are in series inside the gearbox on BROWN and ORANGE.\nWhen an arm reaches its travel limit that circuit OPENS - the controller\nsees the switch release mid-action and stops. Without it the mechanism\nstrains against its stop." (at 241.3 215.9 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1075047c-90a5-48b2-a94e-50b67611e74a"))
